Description: THOR Lite — QUICK bounded filescan for fast DFIR triage (NOT a full disk scan)
Category: IOCs
Author: DFIR-project
Version: 1.0
Id: 7a1c0003-0a0a-4b0a-9003-000000000003
BinaryUrl: https://www.nextron-systems.com/thor-lite/
ExportFormat: csv
WaitTimeout: 30
Processors:
    -
        Executable: thor-lite\thor64-lite.exe
        CommandLine: -a Filescan --quick --norescontrol --max_file_size 30000000 -p %sourceDirectory% -e %destinationDirectory%\THOR
        ExportFormat: csv

# NOTE: Tuned for SPEED — scans ONLY the collected triage set (%sourceDirectory%),
# NOT --alldrives, NOT --intense.
# FIX 2026-07-29: removed the invalid flag `--csvfile` (NOT a THOR/THOR-Lite option — absent
# from THOR docs and both stock Thor-Lite_Scan and full Thor_Scan modules; it errored the run).
# THOR's Filescan writes `<hostname>_files_md5s.csv` (md5,path,size) into the -e dir on its own,
# which the bot ingests (parsers/forensic.py classify: name contains 'files_md5s' -> thor_md5).
